也就是后来成为国家广场的地方。

129
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,720
Now, Lawn Front actually gets fired,
现在，劳恩弗兰特实际上被解雇了，

130
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:47,160
so he never has a chance to see his city to fruition.
所以他从未有机会看到他的城市开花结果。

131
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:49,400
But as even though he had this grandmaster vision,
但即使他有这个宏伟的愿景，

132
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:51,920
he had no patience to wait for the red tape
他也没有耐心等待红 Tape（官僚程序）的审批，

133
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:54,720
of government to churn, and he just started bulldozing.
政府流程要运转起来，他立刻就开始推土机作业了。

134
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,240
Like before they bought the farmland,
就像在他们买下农田之前，

135
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,280
he was knocking down people's houses,
他正在推倒人家的房子，

136
00:07:58,280 --> 00:07:59,840
and he was cutting down their crops,
还砍掉了他们的庄稼，

137
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:03,480
and he was shooting their cattle, and so he gets fired.
还把他们的牛给宰了，于是他被解雇了。

138
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,840
He was shooting cattle.
他是在宰牛。

139
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:08,360
Yeah, you don't have to be on a pip to get fired for that.
是啊，你不需要有‘小错’就能因为这事被解雇。

140
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:11,600
So, Launfawn is out, and two other guys step in,
所以，拉恩法恩退出了，两个其他人接上了。

141
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:14,460
named Andrew Ellicott, who had, interestingly enough,
其中一个是安德鲁·埃利奥特，有趣的是，

142
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:19,300
