00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:15,360
Federal troops are pouring into the capital to protect us.
联邦军队正源源不断地涌入首都以保护我们。

165
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:18,400
DC becomes the most fortified city in the world
华盛顿成为世界上最坚固的城市。

166
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:19,600
by the middle of the Civil War,
到内战中期，

167
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:22,040
