00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:06,160
being constructed very slowly, things were not going well.
事情也并不顺利。

181
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:12,080
Post-Soviet war, DC is in a really rough state. Just as an example, the area just off the mall,
战后，华盛顿特区处境非常艰难。就拿离购物中心不远的那片区域来说，

182
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:16,480
that Pennsylvania Avenue runs along, so there's a triangle, right? The mall, I know no one can see
沿着宾夕法尼亚大道，那里有个三角地带，对吧？那商场，我都知道没人能看到

183
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:21,520
the shape that I'm making, that was known as Murder Bay, right on Pennsylvania Avenue, right on the
我正在描述的那个地方，被称为谋杀湾，就位于宾夕法尼亚大道上，就在

