所以当那项纪念性法案在1986年通过时，

538
00:30:37,100 --> 00:30:39,100
they established something called the reserve,
他们设立了所谓的保留区，

539
00:30:39,100 --> 00:30:44,100
which basically said we can't build any memorials in this spot or makes it harder to build.
基本上规定我们不能在这一带建纪念碑，或者让建设变得困难。

540
00:30:44,100 --> 00:30:47,100
And that's been adapted, I think, the last changes in 2003.
而且我认为，这最后的修改是在2003年做出的。

541
00:30:47,100 --> 00:30:51,100
So basically the mall is closed for future memorials,
所以基本上，这个商场今后不再用于纪念性建设，

542
00:30:51,100 --> 00:30:54,100
at least as far as this this congressionally approved document is concerned.
至少就这份经国会批准的文件而言是这样。

543
00:30:54,100 --> 00:30:58,100
So that's the reserve and then there's sort of area one and area two.
所以这就是保留区，然后还有所谓的区域一和区域二。

544
00:30:58,100 --> 00:31:04,100
Area one is where the arch is slated for and that is limited memorials.
区域一就是拱门计划设立的地方，而那地方是靠近纪念堂的区域。

545
00:31:04,100 --> 00:31:09,100
So it's not technically, even though it's on the axis of the bridge, it's behind the Lincoln Memorial,
所以从技术上讲，尽管它在桥的轴线上，但它位于林肯纪念堂之后。

546
00:31:09,100 --> 00:31:12,100
it's not on the technical boundaries of the mall.
它并不在广场的技术边界上。

547
00:31:12,100 --> 00:31:17,100
And the final point of controversy is the symbolism of the arch.
而争议的最后一点，就是拱门的象征意义。

548
00:31:17,100 --> 00:31:23,100
There have been plenty of disagreements and different ideas about the various elements of the National Mall throughout history,
历史上关于国家广场各个元素，一直存在大量分歧和不同想法，

549
00:31:23,100 --> 00:31:29,260
But you can safely say that all of them are deeply imbued with symbolic meaning.
但可以肯定地说，所有这些元素都蕴含着深刻的象征意义。

550
00:31:29,260 --> 00:31:35,740
What event or person does this triumphal arch purport to celebrate or memorialize?
什么事件或人物是这座凯旋门所纪念或庆祝的？

551
00:31:35,740 --> 00:31:39,140
Well it depends on who and when you ask.
这取决于你问的是谁，以及什么时候问的。

552
00:31:39,140 --> 00:31:44,060
Most recently in September of 2026 President Trump said it would double as a quote military
最近在2026年9月，特朗普总统说它将同时成为一座‘军事’

553
00:31:44,060 --> 00:31:49,460
complex with an ammunition storage, snipers and drones.
弹药储存设施、狙击手和无人机的基地。

554
00:31:49,460 --> 00:31:54,900
And back in October of 2025, a reporter asked the president who the arch was for, and Trump's
而早在2025年10月，一名记者问总统这座拱门是为了谁，特朗普的回答是：

555
00:31:54,900 --> 00:31:57,900
reply was, quote, me.
他的回答是：‘我。’

556
00:31:57,900 --> 00:32:03,340
So I asked Carolyn to tell me not what she thought of the proposed arch, but what visitors
所以我问卡罗琳，不要问她对这个提议的拱门有什么看法，而是问游客

557
00:32:03,340 --> 00:32:06,100
