Most of the folks I've talked to consider it an abomination, and showing a complete disregard
我跟大多数人都谈过，他们认为这简直是可恶的，而且是完全无视。

559
00:32:11,580 --> 00:32:16,580
and disrespect for the planning of the city, for the vision both in the early phases with
而且对城市规划，尤其是在早期阶段的构想，

