00:32:16,580 --> 00:32:19,340
with Pierlan Font and the McMillan Plan and now.
以及现在与皮尔兰·冯和麦米兰计划相关的内容。

561
00:32:20,420 --> 00:32:23,320
And there's also a whole list of approvals
而且还有整个一整套审批流程

562
00:32:23,320 --> 00:32:24,880
that need to be gone through
需要一一经过

563
00:32:24,880 --> 00:32:26,560
with the Commemorative Works Act of 1986
根据1986年的纪念性作品法案

564
00:32:26,560 --> 00:32:29,280
