00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:33,600
something larger than himself, right? By communicating the ideals of Abraham Lincoln or George Washington.
一种超越自我的东西，比如通过传播亚伯拉罕·林肯或乔治·华盛顿所代表的理想

585
00:33:33,600 --> 00:33:40,120
But there may be some listeners out there who remember another controversial monument.
但或许有些听众还记得另一座有争议的纪念碑。

