00:34:43,240 --> 00:34:47,640
And then unfortunately, Maya Lin caught a lot of flak herself for being a young Asian-American woman.
然后不幸的是，作为一位年轻的亚裔美国人女性，玛雅·林自己也遭到了大量批评。

